)PANEL
)ATTR DEFAULT(%+_)
)BODY
%----------------- NYC TAXI RIDE ANALYTICS & FRAUD SYSTEM -------------------
%OPTION ===>_ZCMD                                                            +
%                                                         +USERID:  %&ZUSER  +
%                                                         +DATE:    %&ZDATE  +
%                                                         +TIME:    %&ZTIME  +
+FINANCIAL & FRAUD ANALYTICS:
%   1 +MASTER FINANCIAL LEDGER  +Browse 75/25 payout split table
%   2 +FRAUD AUDIT REPORT       +Browse speed > 85 MPH & low fare audit
%   3 +EXECUTIVE SUMMARY        +Browse Top 3 popular zones & routing
+
+ADVANCED BUSINESS INTELLIGENCE:
%   4 +DRIVER LEADERBOARD       +Browse top earning drivers & ride counts
%   5 +DYNAMIC SURGE PRICING    +Browse surge multipliers & analytics
+
+BATCH OPERATIONS & AUDIT LOGS:
%   6 +VIEW EXECUTION AUDIT LOG +Browse step-by-step pipeline logs
%   7 +EXECUTE PIPELINE BATCH   +Submit end-to-end batch job to JES2
%   8 +RAW FIXED PS DATASET     +Browse raw 80-byte master ledger (FILE3)
%   9 +VSAM KSDS DIRECT INDEX   +Browse / Query indexed VSAM cluster
+
%   X +EXIT                     +Return to ISPF Primary Menu
%----------------------------------------------------------------------------
+Select option (1-9) or%X+to exit. Press%ENTER+to view.
)INIT
  .CURSOR = ZCMD
  &ZCMD = ' '
)PROC
)END
